<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2008 stock.</title>
<headline>Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2008 stock.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said it will offer A$100 million of 7.5 percent August 2008 stock at Monday's tender.</p>
<p>The tender is scheduled for 10.30 a.m. local time (0030 GMT) and the result should be known shortly afterwards.</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
